{"id": "70540", "title": "多想说爱你", "author": "云初情", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 14, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70540.htm", "intro": "没有文案哦 不过是云大的文。\n    楠竹；连靖涛\n    女主；夏侯云卷\n    想她好歹也是商业上的女强人，处理各种事情都干净利落，威风八面，为何独独面对他，却怯弱得像一只只会摇头摆尾的笨乌龟？而且是最没骨气的那种！他是她唯一喜欢的那个人啊！一次又一次地想表白，事到临头，却只能一次又一次地逃离。他的清宁淡倦带给她爱慕的心，却带不来表白的勇气，她好想对他说出——我爱你！谁能借她一点点勇气呢？", "base": "files/article/html/70/70540", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10999410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10999411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10999412.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10999413.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10999414.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10999415.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10999416.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10999417.html", "available": true}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10999418.html", "available": true}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10999419.html", "available": true}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10999420.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "11030336.html", "available": true}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "11030337.html", "available": true}, {"title": "71-73", "file": "11030338.html", "available": true}]}